<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>includeGeometry</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>set to TRUE when a WKT string representation of the geometry should be included </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>isCutOperation</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>set to TRUE if this is a cut operation. In that case, when pasting into a different layer, the feature will be deleted from the original layer. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
